                "caption": "Figure 1:Overview of Any-OPD.Left: the anchoring stage trains the student by velocity matching on teacher-generated targets, transferring the teacher’s distribution into the student’s own latent coordinates.Right: on-policy training rolls out the student, projects the sample onto the teacher’s manifold by noise-and-denoise refinement, and back-propagates through the student segment selected by noise-level matching. Student and teacher each decode with their own VAE; the two images meet only in a frozen DINOv2 representation space.",
